OL,3,GNEWSA'Deep-seated cultural issues'     
OL,4,Awithin police force                    
OL,6,FEfforts to address "deep-seated        
OL,7,Fcultural issues" have impacted on a    
OL,8,Fpolice force's performance, a police   
OL,9,Fand crime commissioner has said.       
OL,11,FA report by the police inspectorate    
OL,12,Flast month found leadership at         
OL,13,FGloucestershire Constabulary, along    
OL,14,Fwith the way crimes are investigated,  
OL,15,Fto be inadequate.                      
OL,17,FGloucestershire Police and Crime       
OL,18,FCommissioner (PCC) Chris Nelson said up
OL,19,Fto 50 officers have been suspended at a
OL,20,Ftime during a crackdown on abuses of   
OL,21,Fpower and nepotism.                    
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
