OL,3,GNEWSA'Deep-seated cultural issues'     
OL,4,Awithin police force                    
OL,6,FThe force's chiefs said it had new     
OL,7,Fleaders in place and the inspectorate  
OL,8,Fwas confident their plans would address
OL,9,Fthe issues.                            
